<span data-as=3D"p">Plan mode enables you to:</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>Brainstorm ideas</strong> and explore different approaches to y=
our project</li>
<li><strong>Plan development work</strong> with structured task lists</li>
<li><strong>Collaborate with AI</strong> on project architecture and featur=
e planning</li>
<li><strong>Get strategic guidance</strong> and ask questions without modif=
ying your project=E2=80=99s code or data</li>
<li><strong>Transition seamlessly</strong> to Build mode when you=E2=80=99r=
e ready to implement</li>
</ul>
<span data-as=3D"p">The default mode is now referred to as <strong>Build</s=
trong> mode.</span>
<span data-as=3D"p">Unlike Build mode, Plan mode focuses on planning and id=
eation, helping you think through projects before writing code.</span>
